ve content?\",\"Which structural changes would reduce drift and maintenance burden without over-generalizing?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Use the broad DeepSeek-like predicate as the ownership boundary\",\"Activate deep-pi for every future deepseek-v model id without widening its state model\"],\"focusTrack\":\"architecture\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/README.md\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi.ts\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/eligibility.ts\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/003-fork-and-guard-cache-optimizer/implementation-summary.md\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/006-fork-and-improve-deep-pi/001-fix-and-test-deep-pi/spec.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-08T04:31:58Z\",\"durationMs\":68000,\"keyFindings\":[{\"id\":\"f-ownership-contract-drift\",\"summary\":\"The DeepPi ownership predicate is duplicated across both forks and can drift.\"},{\"id\":\"f-report-ui-only\",\"summary\":\"DeepPi's full report is coupled to ctx.ui.notify.\"},{\"id\":\"f-state-asymmetry\",\"summary\":\"Only pi-cache-optimizer persists cross-session cache economics.\"},{\"id\":\"f-monolith\",\"summary\":\"pi-cache-optimizer concentrates 8,390 lines in one source file.\"},{\"id\":\"f-guard-proven\",\"summary\":\"The six-hook exclusion guard is already liv... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":1,"totalLines":1,"truncated":false}},"title":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","time":{"start":1786167269427,"end":1786167269432}},"id":"prt_fdfdd96e9001reSTOyMgzBDLLD","sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","messageID":"msg_fdfdd82b4001lC0GA1n6ifLj3o"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786167269800,"sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_02_ngIv8HHoQ3NTBTYX3j6J9845","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-1786163355542-f6htbk\",\n3:   \"parentSessionId\": null,\n4:   \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n5:   \"generation\": 1,\n6:   \"continuedFromRun\": null,\n7:   \"terminalStop\": {\n8:     \"stopReason\": \"maxIterationsReached\",\n9:     \"totalIterations\": 7,\n10:     \"answeredCount\": 5,\n11:     \"totalQuestions\": 5,\n12:     \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-08T04:44:10Z\"\n13:   },\n14:   \"keyQuestions\": [\n15:     {\"id\":\"question-1-correctness\",\"text\":\"Which correctness and failure-isolation gaps remain in each fork?\",\"addedAtIteration\":0,\"resolvedAtIteration\":2,\"resolved\":true},\n16:     {\"id\":\"question-2-tests\",\"text\":\"Which high-value boundary, fault-injection, and live-contract tests are missing?\",\"addedAtIteration\":0,\"resolvedAtIteration\":3,\"resolved\":true},\n17:     {\"id\":\"question-3-observability\",\"text\":\"How should both forks expose durable, automation-friendly telemetry without leaking sensitive content?\",\"addedAtIteration\":0,\"resolvedAtIteration\":4,\"resolved\":true},\n18:     {\"id\":\"question-4-economics\",\"text\":\"Which cost claims can be measured honestly, and what experiment design is needed?\",\"addedAtIteration\":0,\"resolvedAtIteration\":5,\"resolved\":true},\n19:     {\"id\":\"question-5-maintainability\",\"text\":\"Which structural changes would reduce drift and maintenance burden without over-generalizing?\",\"addedAtIteration\":0,\"resolvedAtIteration\":6,\"resolved\":true}\n20:   ],\n21:   \"openQuestions\": [],\n22:   \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n23:     \"Which correctness and failure-isolation gaps remain in each fork?\",\n24:     \"Which high-value boundary, fault-injection, and live-contract tests are missing?\",\n25:     \"How should both forks expose durable, automation-friendly telemetry without leaking sensitive content?\",\n26:     \"Which cost claims can be measured honestly, and what experiment design is needed?\",\n27:     \"Which structural changes would reduce drift and maintenance burden without over-generalizing?\"\n28:   ],\n29:   \"uncoveredQuestions\": [\n30:     \"What paid-run budget and target model matrix should govern crossover rounds?\",\n31:     \"Can direct DeepSeek ever produce nonzero normalized cacheWrite usage in Pi?\",\n32:     \"How often do normal deployments share cache-optimizer state across Pi processes?\",\n33:     \"Do real DeepPi deployments have concurrent external writers during edit_lines?\"\n34:   ],\n35:   \"keyFindings\": [\n36:     {\"id\":\"f-ownership-contract-drift\",\"text\":\"The DeepPi ownership predicate is duplicated across both forks and can drift.\",\"addedAtIteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/eligibility.ts:1\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:1279\"]},\n37:     {\"id\":\"f-report-ui-only\",\"text\":\"DeepPi's full report is coupled to ctx.ui.notify.\",\"addedAtIteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi.ts:64\"]},\n38:     {\"id\":\"f-state-asymmetry\",\"text\":\"Only pi-cache-optimizer persists cross-session cache economics.\",\"addedAtIteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:4264\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts\"]},\n39:     {\"id\":\"f-monolith\",\"text\":\"pi-cache-optimizer concentrates approximately 8,390 lines in one source file.\",\"addedAtIteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts\"]},\n40:     {\"id\":\"f-guard-proven\",\"text\":\"The six-hook exclusion guard is already live-proven; future work should focus on drift detection.\",\"addedAtIteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:7280\"]},\n41:     {\"id\":\"f-pco-cross-process-lost-update\",\"text\":\"Cache-optimizer shared stats read/merge/rename has no cross-process concurrency control.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:4215\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:4264\"]},\n42:     {\"id\":\"f-pco-corrupt-overwrite\",\"text\":\"Malformed persisted stats are silently treated as empty and can be overwritten.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:4293\"]},\n43:     {\"id\":\"f-pco-temp-hygiene\",\"text\":\"Persistence temp files use weak uniqueness and lack guaranteed cleanup.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:4306\"]},\n44:     {\"id\":\"f-deeppi-cas-gap\",\"text\":\"edit_lines has a cross-process TOCTOU window between expected-content check and rename.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/hashlines.ts:83\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/hashlines.ts:91\"]},\n45:     {\"id\":\"f-persistence-test-gap\",\"text\":\"Cache optimizer lacks direct persistence fault and race tests.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/tests/review-findings.test.ts\"]},\n46:     {\"id\":\"f-deeppi-broken-live-benchmark\",\"text\":\"DeepPi's documented benchmark command points to a missing, unpackaged script.\",\"addedAtIteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/package.json:36\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/package.json:56\"]},\n47:     {\"id\":\"f-pco-runtime-test-blindspots\",\"text\":\"Cache optimizer tests omit direct persistence, adapter-matrix, and message_end state coverage.\",\"addedAtIteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/tests/review-findings.test.ts\"]},\n48:     {\"id\":\"f-cold-start-test-design\",\"text\":\"Cold-start characterization requires structured first/second/restart measurements.\",\"addedAtIteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:3645\"]},\n49:     {\"id\":\"f-credential-independent-boundary-test\",\"text\":\"A local Pi/provider fixture can prove routing boundaries without an OpenCode credential.\",\"addedAtIteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/tests/fake-pi.ts\"]},\n50:     {\"id\":\"f-risk-based-coverage\",\"text\":\"Both packages need per-module risk-based coverage baselines after modularization.\",\"addedAtIteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/tests\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/tests\"]},\n51:     {\"id\":\"f-deeppi-versioned-snapshot\",\"text\":\"DeepPi should atomically persist a versioned structured report used by TUI and automation.\",\"addedAtIteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi.ts:64\"]},\n52:     {\"id\":\"f-deeppi-dual-scope-stats\",\"text\":\"DeepPi needs current-session and daily cumulative telemetry scopes.\",\"addedAtIteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:80\"]},\n53:     {\"id\":\"f-pco-durable-health-aggregates\",\"text\":\"Cache optimizer should persist bounded health aggregates instead of raw samples.\",\"addedAtIteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:370\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:6818\"]},\n54:     {\"id\":\"f-report-data-render-transport\",\"text\":\"Both forks should separate report data, text rendering, and transport.\",\"addedAtIteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:94\"]},\n55:     {\"id\":\"f-health-counters\",\"text\":\"Both forks need explicit parse/write/guard/missing-usage health counters.\",\"addedAtIteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:7025\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:27\"]},\n56:     {\"id\":\"f-savings-counterfactual-label\",\"text\":\"DeepPi's savings arithmetic is a no-cache counterfactual, not causal extension savings.\",\"addedAtIteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:47\",\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/kv_cache\"]},\n57:     {\"id\":\"f-cache-write-accounting\",\"text\":\"DeepPi silently omits nonzero cache-write usage and should surface the model-specific assumption.\",\"addedAtIteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:50\"]},\n58:     {\"id\":\"f-price-provenance\",\"text\":\"Benchmark outputs need timestamped model-price provenance rather than hard-coded current rates.\",\"addedAtIteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing\"]},\n59:     {\"id\":\"f-crossover-benchmark\",\"text\":\"Cold/warm economics require repeated randomized enabled/disabled crossover measurements.\",\"addedAtIteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/kv_cache\"]},\n60:     {\"id\":\"f-local-overhead-ablation\",\"text\":\"Monotonic per-hook timing and feature ablations are needed to isolate extension overhead.\",\"addedAtIteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi.ts:20\"]},\n61:     {\"id\":\"f-fork-build-identity\",\"text\":\"Both forks need unique build identity and local provenance instead of unchanged upstream metadata.\",\"addedAtIteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/package.json:3\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/package.json:3\"]},\n62:     {\"id\":\"f-ownership-contract-fixture\",\"text\":\"A shared fixture matrix can prevent predicate drift without runtime package coupling.\",\"addedAtIteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/eligibility.ts:1\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:6508\"]},\n63:     {\"id\":\"f-pco-staged-modularization\",\"text\":\"Cache optimizer modularization should proceed by characterized responsibility seams.\",\"addedAtIteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:6471\"]},\n64:     {\"id\":\"f-deeppi-hygiene-gates\",\"text\":\"Duplicate declarations and missing script packaging justify structural hygiene gates.\",\"addedAtIteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/hashlines.ts:165\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/package.json:56\"]},\n65:     {\"id\":\"f-patch-ledger\",\"text\":\"A machine-readable upstream base and patch ledger should make reconciliation auditable.\",\"addedAtIteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/package.json:45\",\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/package.json:7\"]},\n66:     {\"id\":\"f-priority-evidence-floor\",\"text\":\"Build local executable evidence and ownership fixtures before behavioral refactors.\",\"addedAtIteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"iterations/iteration-003.md\",\"iterations/iteration-007.md\"]},\n67:     {\"id\":\"f-priority-pco-persistence\",\"text\":\"Cache-optimizer cross-process persistence is the highest-severity correctness package.\",\"addedAtIteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"iterations/iteration-002.md\",\"iterations/iteration-007.md\"]},\n68:     {\"id\":\"f-priority-deeppi-snapshot\",\"text\":\"DeepPi's structured persistent report is the next product-facing foundation.\",\"addedAtIteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"iterations/iteration-004.md\",\"iterations/iteration-007.md\"]},\n69:     {\"id\":\"f-priority-economic-sequencing\",\"text\":\"Fix cost semantics now but defer causal claims until controlled ablation.\",\"addedAtIteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"iterations/iteration-005.md\",\"iterations/iteration-007.md\"]},\n70:     {\"id\":\"f-priority-staged-maintenance\",\"text\":\"Ship cheap provenance gates before staged modularization and defer unproven lock complexity.