{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786167512657,"sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_ET_l5SUymnq1uFz2j64BZAm8953","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Research Dashboard — deepseek-flash lineage\n\n## Lifecycle\n\n- Session: `fanout-deepseek-flash-1786167193415-427cev` | Generation 1 | Mode `new`\n- Status: iterating | Iteration 1 of 4 complete\n- Stop policy: max-iterations | Convergence threshold: 0.05 (telemetry only before iteration 4)\n\n## Iteration Table\n\n| run | focus | newInfoRatio | findings count | status |\n|-----|-------|--------------|----------------|--------|\n| 1 | Independent corroboration of Tier 1/2 findings | 0.8 | 5 | complete |\n\n## Question Status\n\n1/6 answered.\n\n- [x] Q1 — Tier 1/2 findings corroborated/refuted from own source read (iteration 1)\n- [ ] Q2 — correctness/failure-isolation gaps beyond disclosed set\n- [ ] Q3 — missing boundary/fault-injection/live-contract tests\n- [ ] Q4 — durable automation-friendly telemetry without sensitive content\n- [ ] Q5 — honest cost claims + cold-start cache-write behavior\n- [ ] Q6 — maintainability improvements beyond provenance drift\n\n## Convergence Trend\n\n- newInfoRatio trend: `[0.8]`\n- Rolling avg (needs 3): unavailable\n- MAD noise floor (needs 4): unavailable\n- Composite stop score: n/a (below min iterations)\n- Signals: RollingAvg=UNAVAILABLE MAD=UNAVAILABLE Entropy=CONTINUE\n\n## Dead Ends\n\n- Chasing `errorsEnhanced` — counter does not exist in the live deep-pi tree (stale name in parent synthesis).\n\n## Blocked Stops\n\nNone.\n\n## Next Focus\n\nDeep-dive correctness and test coverage: `message_end` stopReason guard, numeric input validation, hashlines edit path, and pi-cache-optimizer test coverage gaps.\n\n## Active Risks\n\n- None so far; iteration 1 was clean corroboration.\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/deep-research-dashboard.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1786167512649,"end":1786167512655}},"id":"prt_fdfe140f9001V0QszMYpCwoMN1","sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","messageID":"msg_fdfe132c2001klmlRrSjdCYx1V"}}
