failed attempt flips usageUnavailable permanently.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:135\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:7576\"]},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-numeric-validation-absent\",\"text\":\"deep-pi recordUsage trusts unvalidated numeric usage; cache-optimizer validates isFinite.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/telemetry.ts:60\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:1065\"]},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-interior-line-staleness\",\"text\":\"edit_lines validates only range endpoints; in-place interior changes are silently overwritten.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/hashlines.ts:403\"]},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-post-rename-verification\",\"text\":\"atomicWriteFile already verifies landed content post-rename; parent TOCTOU severity is overstated for deep-pi.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/extensions/deeppi/hashlines.ts:91\"]},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-test-fixture-gaps\",\"text\":\"Both suites omit pure-cache-write, stopReason, NaN/negative, and persistence/restart cases.\",\"addedAtIteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/deep-pi/tests/telemetry.test.ts:14\",\".pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/tests/review-findings.test.ts:10\"]}\n   ],\n   \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n     \"Enforce ownership split via a shared runtime module\",\n-    \"Rely on parent-synthesis counter names without re-checking current source (errorsEnhanced is stale)\"\n+    \"Rely on parent-synthesis counter names without re-checking current source (errorsEnhanced is stale)\",\n+    \"Treat post-rename verification as strict CAS\"\n   ],\n   \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n   \"divergence\": {\n     \"saturatedDirections\": [],\n@@ -44,14 +50,14 @@\n     \"councilArtifactRefs\": [],\n     \"remainingFrontier\": []\n   },\n   \"metrics\": {\n-    \"iterationsCompleted\": 1,\n-    \"openQuestions\": 5,\n-    \"resolvedQ