rity for deep-pi's `atomicWriteFile` is overstated; post-rename verification exists.\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/deep-research-dashboard.md","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/039-pi-caching-like-reasonix/007-research-fork-improvements/research/lineages/deepseek-flash/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1786167687831,"end":1786167687838}},"id":"prt_fdfe3eedf001VwwhvW3zO372xT","sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","messageID":"msg_fdfe3dee5001sfk8BXBiQ0w651"}}
