{"type":"text","timestamp":1786168209182,"sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","part":{"id":"prt_fdfebe379001n7ImggqA6FlfBj","messageID":"msg_fdfebd2f0001JcWz8MUGkI7YNQ","sessionID":"ses_020238d7affe3gDc79EXqntLlP","type":"text","text":"Deep-research loop complete for the `deepseek-flash` lineage. Summary:\n\n- **Phases**: init → 4-iteration main loop (stop policy `max-iterations`, convergence treated as telemetry only) → synthesis. All state written to `research/lineages/deepseek-flash/`.\n- **Corroborated** all parent Tier 1 findings (ownership predicate duplication, UI-notify-only report, no persistent deep-pi stats, cache-write cost omission) plus Tier 2 #6-#9 with exact line evidence.\n- **8 genuinely new mechanisms**, most notably: deep-pi's establishing cache write is silently dropped *and* flips `usageUnavailable` permanently; the `stopReason`-guard gap has a concrete misreport consequence; `edit_lines` endpoint-only validation allows interior-line clobber; the `FakePi` composition-test seam is blocked by divergent test runners; `benchmark:live` is doubly broken (script missing + `files` allowlist excludes `scripts/`).\n- **2 corrections** to the parent synthesis: deep-pi's TOCTOU severity overstated (post-rename verification exists), and this lineage's own iteration-1 `errorsEnhanced` refutation was a false negative (parent `f-014` stands).\n- **Artifacts**: config/strategy/state/registry/dashboard, 4 iterations + deltas, `research.md` synthesis, convergence-report (md+json), resource-map, logs — all JSONL/JSON validated, all writes inside the lineage boundary.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:deepseek-flash","time":{"start":1786168206201,"end":1786168209180}}}
